{
  "$schema": "../meta_schema.json",
  "key": "projects",
  "title": "Projects",
  "description": "Active work and side projects",
  "core": false,
  "position": 40,
  "defaults": {
    "projects": [],
    "top_of_mind": []
  },
  "id_lists": [
    [
      "projects",
      "project"
    ],
    [
      "top_of_mind",
      "top"
    ]
  ],
  "scope_contributions": {
    "minimal": [
      "top_of_mind"
    ],
    "professional": [
      "projects",
      "top_of_mind"
    ],
    "learning": [
      "top_of_mind"
    ]
  },
  "sections": [
    {
      "kind": "list",
      "path": [
        "top_of_mind"
      ],
      "title": "Top of Mind",
      "info": {
        "overview": "Capture quick ideas, thoughts, or things you want to explore. Think of it as a scratchpad for inspiration before it becomes a full project.",
        "tips": [
          "Idea: A short phrase or sentence describing what you're thinking about.",
          "Note: Optional context — why this idea excites you, potential next steps, or related thoughts.",
          "Use this for: half-baked concepts, 'what if' questions, problems you want to solve, things to research later.",
          "When an idea matures, you can promote it to a full project with more details."
        ]
      },
      "search": true,
      "element": {
        "entity": "top_of_mind",
        "identifier": "idea",
        "actions": [
          "add",
          "remove"
        ],
        "description": "Inbox for fleeting ideas and current thoughts — expect entries to be pruned",
        "fields": [
          {
            "name": "idea",
            "required": true,
            "role": "title",
            "placeholder": "Project idea or thing you want to build...",
            "alias": [
              "item"
            ]
          },
          {
            "name": "note",
            "placeholder": "Add a note (optional)..."
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "kind": "list",
      "path": [
        "projects"
      ],
      "title": "Projects",
      "info": {
        "overview": "Track your active work, side projects, and completed endeavors. This helps AI understand what you're building and can reference past experience.",
        "tips": [
          "Name: Clear, descriptive title for the project.",
          "Status: Idea (still in ideation/research), Active (currently working on it), Paused (temporarily on hold), Completed (finished and shipped), Archived (no longer relevant but kept for reference).",
          "Description: What the project is about and your goals.",
          "Tags: Keywords for easy filtering and AI context.",
          "References: Links to repos, docs, designs, or related resources.",
          "Highlights: Wins and milestones worth remembering.",
          "Notes: Progress updates, blockers, or lessons learned."
        ]
      },
      "search": true,
      "facets": [
        "status"
      ],
      "element": {
        "entity": "project",
        "identifier": "name",
        "fields": [
          {
            "name": "name",
            "required": true,
            "role": "title",
            "placeholder": "e.g. Personal website, Mobile app"
          },
          {
            "name": "description",
            "type": "longtext",
            "required": true,
            "placeholder": "Brief description..."
          },
          {
            "name": "notes",
            "type": "longtext",
            "placeholder": "Additional notes, blockers, or context..."
          },
          {
            "name": "references",
            "type": "list",
            "show": [
              "count"
            ],
            "label": "References",
            "element": {
              "entity": "project_reference",
              "identifier": "name",
              "parent": "project_name",
              "fields": [
                {
                  "name": "name",
                  "required": true,
                  "role": "title",
                  "placeholder": "Reference name",
                  "alias": [
                    "ref_name"
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "name": "url",
                  "placeholder": "URL (optional)"
                },
                {
                  "name": "notes",
                  "type": "longtext",
                  "placeholder": "Notes about this resource (optional)..."
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "name": "tags",
            "type": "strings",
            "show": [
              "form",
              "count"
            ],
            "placeholder": "Add tag...",
            "element": {
              "entity": "project_tag",
              "identifier": "tag",
              "parent": "project_name"
            }
          },
          {
            "name": "highlights",
            "type": "strings",
            "show": [
              "form",
              "count"
            ],
            "placeholder": "e.g. Cut load time by 40%, Shipped the beta",
            "element": {
              "entity": "project_highlight",
              "identifier": "highlight",
              "parent": "project_name"
            }
          },
          {
            "name": "status",
            "type": "enum",
            "values": [
              "active",
              "paused",
              "completed",
              "archived",
              "idea"
            ],
            "show": [
              "badge"
            ]
          },
          {
            "name": "added_date",
            "show": [
              "row"
            ],
            "ui_only": true
          }
        ]
      },
      "$comment": "On the entity: `required` was [\"name\"] until wave 8 while the branch has always demanded name AND description. `name` alone remains the identifier for update/remove; `required` describes `add`. Found by the stored-key audit."
    }
  ]
}
